name: hermetic
repo: https://github.com/forefy/hermetic
sha: {{SHA}}
version: "{{VERSION}}"
requires_hermes: ">=0.21.6"
description: "Status-bar popover for Hermes Desktop with three views: Costs (spend, cache, pricing drift, OpenRouter provider routing), AAI (skill changes, ratings, tests and replays) and HDR (a guard for risky tool calls, hooks, destinations, sensitive paths, what runs on its own). Disclosure: reads this profile's sessions (and other profiles' when you pick them) to audit tool calls, paths and hosts; can edit and save config.yaml and rewrite skill files when you ship or revert a version; AAI replays and judge runs resend conversation context and tool definitions to OpenRouter with your OpenRouter key and incur cost; HDR lists listening TCP ports via ps/lsof; HDR's guard (off by default) checks each tool call through a pre_tool_call hook and, when you turn it on, holds calls Hermes does not check itself (reading keys and logins, writing startup items or key places Hermes does not list) and asks you in its own card or a macOS notification, blocking after 20 seconds without an answer, or blocks them outright; HDR also lists shell and gateway hooks and flags hook scripts edited after approval, keeping a copy of each script to compare; Costs reads public model price lists (OpenRouter, and hopscotchlabs.ai model pages for models a profile is billed for through Hopscotch)."
maintainer: forefy
tier: community
category: desktop
docs_url: https://github.com/forefy/hermetic#readme
title: "Hermetic"
image: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-banner.png
screenshots:
  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-costs.png
  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-aai.png
  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-hdr.png
  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-providers.png
  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-hdr-pipeline.png
  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/forefy/hermetic/{{SHA}}/docs/hermetic-aai-settings.png
capabilities:
  provides_tools: []
  provides_hooks:{{HOOKS}}
  provides_middleware:{{MIDDLEWARE}}
  requires_env: []
